[Remote Rule]
https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/217heidai/adblockfilters/releases/download/rule/adblockloon.list, policy=REJECT, tag=广告拦截, enabled=true
# Claude 按用户指定来源优先；不再叠加其他 Claude 规则集。
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/VPSDance/ai-proxy-rules@main/rules/loon/anthropic.list, policy=Claude, tag=Anthropic, enabled=true
# Apple Intelligence / Siri 按用户指定完整来源，置于其他 Apple 规则之前。
